Bikewise Pro is developed for a new generation of "B-COCKPiT" platform, which integrates a series of new functions and new characteristics such as Ebike management, cycling intercom, GO sports, social interaction and cycling Device access.

It is designed to work with the new generation of "B-COCKPiT" smart bike hardware.

Bikewise Pro includes the following core functions:

1. Ebike management: including Ebike pairing, Ebike display, Ebike settings, as well as historical movement records, rankings, etc.;

2. Cycling intercom: Including friends group up, enabling remote intercom function during cycling, supporting Bluetooth headsets, supporting instrument buttons to control microphones, and easily solving cycling communication Problems;

3. GO Sports: It includes three functions: GO cycling, navigation and navigation mapping. GO cycling combines mobile phone GPS positioning to record your riding track. If you do not use this function, we will not record any of your location information. The navigation adopts the Professional cycling navigation service solution and the navigation information can be mapped to the instrument, allowing you to focus on riding and arrive at the destination smoothly.

4. Social: Everyone can post here to share their Ebike comment, follow, like their favorite person or article, and exchange riding experience and use experience ;

5. Riding Device: A variety of riding Device and accessories have been added, such as smart helmets, cycling recorders, smart turn signals, smart transmissions, smart electronic locks, etc. Rich riding equipment to help you ride experience.

6. Data synchronization: Support app to synchronize cycling data to Apple Health and Strava.
